":27,"assetUrlMd":28,"assetUrlLg":29,"assetUrlXl":30,"assetUrlXxl":31},"1498","Kittl in cursive over white background.","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1498/Kittl.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1498/xs_Kittl.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1498/sm_Kittl.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1498/md_Kittl.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1498/lg_Kittl.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1498/xl_Kittl.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1498/xxl_Kittl.jpg",{"id":33,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":34,"assetUrlXs":35,"assetUrlSm":36,"assetUrlMd":37,"assetUrlLg":38,"assetUrlXl":39,"assetUrlXxl":40},"2143","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2143/IVP_PortCo_Logos_520px_032626_Kittl.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2143/xs_IVP_PortCo_Logos_520px_032626_Kittl.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2143/sm_IVP_PortCo_Logos_520px_032626_Kittl.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2143/md_IVP_PortCo_Logos_520px_032626_Kittl.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2143/lg_IVP_PortCo_Logos_520px_032626_Kittl.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2143/xl_IVP_PortCo_Logos_520px_032626_Kittl.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2143/xxl_IVP_PortCo_Logos_520px_032626_Kittl.png",{"id":42,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":43,"assetUrlXs":44,"assetUrlSm":45,"assetUrlMd":46,"assetUrlLg":47,"assetUrlXl":48,"assetUrlXxl":49},"2144","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2144/IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Kittl.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2144/xs_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Kittl.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2144/sm_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Kittl.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2144/md_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Kittl.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2144/lg_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Kittl.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2144/xl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Kittl.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2144/xxl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Kittl.jpg","#17A191",[],{"contentTopicImage":53,"name":55,"slug":56},{"id":54,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":8,"assetUrlXs":8,"assetUrlSm":8,"assetUrlMd":8,"assetUrlLg":8,"assetUrlXl":8,"assetUrlXxl":8},"2429","Announcements","announcement",false,"2024-01-23","Kittl: Empowering Creativity | IVP",{"id":61,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":62,"assetUrlXs":63,"assetUrlSm":64,"assetUrlMd":65,"assetUrlLg":66,"assetUrlXl":67,"assetUrlXxl":68},"1503","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1503/IVP-Kittl-1200x630.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1503/xs_IVP-Kittl-1200x630.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1503/sm_IVP-Kittl-1200x630.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1503/md_IVP-Kittl-1200x630.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1503/lg_IVP-Kittl-1200x630.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1503/xl_IVP-Kittl-1200x630.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1503/xxl_IVP-Kittl-1200x630.jpg",{"id":70,"alt":7,"caption":7,"assetUrl":8,"assetUrlXs":8,"assetUrlSm":8,"assetUrlMd":8,"assetUrlLg":8,"assetUrlXl":8,"assetUrlXxl":8},"1505",[72,76,88],{"instance":73},{"__typename":74,"largeHeading":7,"heading":7,"body":75},"TextBlock","Design is everywhere. It influences how we think, defines culture and shapes how we interact with and perceive the world around us. The best businesses in the world are built on elegant design, and “design-first” companies stand out in the modern marketplace. However, anyone who has built a product or business realizes that becoming “design-first” is easier said than done.\r\n\r\nSomewhere along the way, graphic designers got left behind. The creative people, whose business is to create logos, assets and images (the foundations of great design), are stuck using complex, desktop-based tools like Adobe Illustrator. It makes no sense to us that graphic design businesses should be limited to using software from the 1980s, especially as we enter a new age of generative AI design. The founders of Kittl, [Nicolas Heymann](https://www.linkedin.com/in/nicolasheymann/) and [Tobias Saul](https://www.linkedin.com/in/tobias-saul-b233011aa/), agreed.",{"instance":77},{"__typename":78,"heading":7,"image":79},"FullImage",{"id":80,"alt":7,"caption":7,"assetUrl":81,"assetUrlXs":82,"assetUrlSm":83,"assetUrlMd":84,"assetUrlLg":85,"assetUrlXl":86,"assetUrlXxl":87},"1506","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1506/IVP-Kittl-1840x1230.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1506/xs_IVP-Kittl-1840x1230.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1506/sm_IVP-Kittl-1840x1230.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1506/md_IVP-Kittl-1840x1230.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1506/lg_IVP-Kittl-1840x1230.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1506/xl_IVP-Kittl-1840x1230.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1506/xxl_IVP-Kittl-1840x1230.jpg",{"instance":89},{"__typename":74,"largeHeading":7,"heading":7,"body":90},"[Kittl](https://www.kittl.com/) enables anyone to create sophisticated designs, with pixel-perfect accuracy, regardless of background or experience level. Since launching in mid-2022, Kittl has amassed well over 1 million users and has among the highest engagement from customers that we have seen in the category. Most importantly, Kittl is embracing the fast-moving developments in AI, crafting their product to make graphic designers even more successful. \r\n\r\nToday, we are announcing that IVP has led Kittl’s $36 million Series B, to help the company on its goal of becoming the leading platform for creatives that monetize their designs. We believe Kittl will pull teams of graphic designers forward into the AI age, helping them design, collaborate, and serve their clients in ways that were never before possible. Check out the product at [Kittl.com](https://www.kittl.com/)!\r\n\r\nKittl is [hiring](https://www.kittl.com/career) engineers, product managers, and sales leaders in Berlin and London.",{"id":92,"assetUrl":8},"396",{"assetUrl":8},[],"kittl-empowering-creativity",[97,124,157],{"fullName":98,"teamSubcategories":99,"slug":110,"image":111,"abbreviatedTitle":120,"focusAreas":121,"emailAddress":122,"bio":123},"Alex Lim",[100,106],{"name":101,"slug":102,"teamCategory":103},"Consumer","consumer",{"name":104,"slug":105},"Investors","investors",{"name":107,"slug":108,"teamCategory":109},"Fintech & Crypto","fintech-crypto",{"name":104,"slug":105},"alex-lim",{"id":112,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":113,"assetUrlXs":114,"assetUrlSm":115,"assetUrlMd":116,"assetUrlLg":117,"assetUrlXl":118,"assetUrlXxl":119},"2335","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2335/IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Alex_Lim.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2335/xs_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Alex_Lim.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2335/sm_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Alex_Lim.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2335/md_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Alex_Lim.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2335/lg_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Alex_Lim.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2335/xl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Alex_Lim.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2335/xxl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Alex_Lim.jpg","General Partner ","Consumer, Collaboration, Automation and Applied AI","alim@ivp.com","I moved to San Francisco, sight unseen, after reading the Facebook S-1. My freshman class was one of the first to use Facebook, and I could hardly believe the scale and impact of the business Facebook had seemingly built overnight. After living in London, New York, Singapore and Sydney, I was fascinated to discover what made Silicon Valley the world’s best environment for empowering entrepreneurs.\r\n\r\nAfter almost a decade in San Francisco, I was inspired to bring the Valley mentality to my native UK, and to the rest of Europe. We set up IVP London to accelerate European entrepreneurs’ global ambitions.\r\n\r\nI’ve been lucky to work closely with category-defining founders at companies like Discord, Hims & Hers, and UiPath. These experiences guided my personal approach to working with entrepreneurs: Listen hard, challenge when necessary, and be authentic, no matter what.",{"fullName":125,"teamSubcategories":126,"slug":143,"image":144,"abbreviatedTitle":153,"focusAreas":154,"emailAddress":155,"bio":156},"Eric Liaw",[127,131,135,137,141],{"name":128,"slug":129,"teamCategory":130},"All","investors-all",{"name":104,"slug":105},{"name":132,"slug":133,"teamCategory":134},"Apps","apps",{"name":104,"slug":105},{"name":101,"slug":102,"teamCategory":136},{"name":104,"slug":105},{"name":138,"slug":139,"teamCategory":140},"Digital Health","digital-health",{"name":104,"slug":105},{"name":107,"slug":108,"teamCategory":142},{"name":104,"slug":105},"eric-liaw",{"id":145,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":146,"assetUrlXs":147,"assetUrlSm":148,"assetUrlMd":149,"assetUrlLg":150,"assetUrlXl":151,"assetUrlXxl":152},"2353","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2353/IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Eric_Liaw.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2353/xs_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Eric_Liaw.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2353/sm_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Eric_Liaw.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2353/md_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Eric_Liaw.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2353/lg_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Eric_Liaw.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2353/xl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Eric_Liaw.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2353/xxl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Eric_Liaw.jpg","General Partner","Enterprise Software, Gaming & AR2, Bottom-Up Solutions, Consumer, FinTech","eliaw@ivp.com","I came to IVP not only for what we do but how we do it. We partner with entrepreneurs right as they approach an inflection point—the moment when identifying and equipping an organization with the right ingredients can make an astronomical difference in its trajectory. Together, we’re able to shape the future of high-growth startups and, as a result, the future of our world.\r\n\r\nIt’s a true privilege to work with entrepreneurs and founders who are pushing the envelope to solve pressing issues that serve their customers. Supporting those founders with hard work is its own reward. My commitment to entrepreneurs is to be available whenever they need me.",{"fullName":158,"teamSubcategories":159,"slug":164,"image":165,"abbreviatedTitle":174,"focusAreas":175,"emailAddress":176,"bio":177},"Shreyas Garg",[160,162],{"name":101,"slug":102,"teamCategory":161},{"name":104,"slug":105},{"name":107,"slug":108,"teamCategory":163},{"name":104,"slug":105},"shreyas-garg",{"id":166,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":167,"assetUrlXs":168,"assetUrlSm":169,"assetUrlMd":170,"assetUrlLg":171,"assetUrlXl":172,"assetUrlXxl":173},"2388","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2388/IVP_Headshots_1090px_D_Shreyas_Garg.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2388/xs_IVP_Headshots_1090px_D_Shreyas_Garg.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2388/sm_IVP_Headshots_1090px_D_Shreyas_Garg.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2388/md_IVP_Headshots_1090px_D_Shreyas_Garg.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2388/lg_IVP_Headshots_1090px_D_Shreyas_Garg.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2388/xl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_D_Shreyas_Garg.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2388/xxl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_D_Shreyas_Garg.jpg","Partner","SaaS, Consumer, Fintech","sgarg@ivp.com","I wrote my first line of code at 14. It started with spending a few hours teaching a robot named Karel to navigate a screen, but quickly escalated to thousands of hours where I built an AI that beat me at board games, trained a neural net in high school, and even launched a Twitter clone on crypto rails (it raised a bit of funding before it shut it down).\r\n\r\nI studied computer science for eight years and spent every college summer in the Bay Area, eventually moving to San Francisco right after graduation. For as long as I can remember, it’s been clear to me that few things shape the world more profoundly than technology.\r\n\r\nVenture has always felt like a dream job. I love meeting exceptional founders, wherever they are, and supporting them on the journey of solving ambitious problems. I helped launch our London office in 2023, and took nearly 150 flights during that time to connect with entrepreneurs around the globe.\r\n\r\nI'm a generalist at heart. I believe technology can reshape every aspect of society, and I love hearing the creative solutions founders come up with to impact the world in ways I could never have imagined on my own.",{"id":179,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":180,"assetUrlXs":181,"assetUrlSm":182,"assetUrlMd":183,"assetUrlLg":184,"assetUrlXl":185,"assetUrlXxl":186},"1504","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1504/IVP-Kittl-800x800.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1504/xs_IVP-Kittl-800x800.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1504/sm_IVP-Kittl-800x800.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1504/md_IVP-Kittl-800x800.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1504/lg_IVP-Kittl-800x800.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1504/xl_IVP-Kittl-800x800.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1504/xxl_IVP-Kittl-800x800.jpg","Kittl: Empowering Creativity",1790351928522]